# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SECRETS — never commit. A key pushed to GitHub is compromised the moment it
# lands: forks, caches and the events API keep it after the commit is deleted.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
deploy/env.production

# The deployment guide renders the live credentials into Appendix A by design.
# It is regenerated from .env with: python3 docs/generate_deploy_pdf.py
docs/Adaptive_Green_AI_Deployment.pdf

